@startuml
title EcoTrack Platform - Carbon Footprint Calculation Frontend Bounded Context Layers
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle

package "Carbon Footprint Calculation Frontend Bounded Context" {
  class "Presentation" as Frontend_footprint_Presentation <<layer>>
  class "Application" as Frontend_footprint_Application <<layer>>
  class "Domain" as Frontend_footprint_Domain <<layer>>
  class "Infrastructure" as Frontend_footprint_Infrastructure <<layer>>
}

Frontend_footprint_Presentation ..> Frontend_footprint_Application : dispatches actions
Frontend_footprint_Application ..> Frontend_footprint_Domain : reads / updates view models
Frontend_footprint_Application ..> Frontend_footprint_Infrastructure : requests data
Frontend_footprint_Infrastructure ..> Frontend_footprint_Domain : maps responses to

@enduml
